# Keep development notes local; publish READMEs, legal notices and the two development guides
*.[mM][dD]
![Rr][Ee][Aa][Dd][Mm][Ee]*.[mM][dD]
![Ll][Ii][Cc][Ee][Nn][Ss][Ee]*.[mM][dD]
![Nn][Oo][Tt][Ii][Cc][Ee]*.[mM][dD]
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES*.[mM][dD]
/docs/*
!/docs/development.md
!/docs/development.en.md

